# Switzerland Crime Analysis

## Objective
Analyze the relationship between economic and social factors and crime rates across Swiss cantons.

## Dataset
- Source: Swiss statistics (26 cantons)
- Variables: GDP, asylum seekers, number of offenses

## Methods
- Correlation analysis
- Linear regression
- Contingency tables
- Boxplots

## Tools
R, ggplot2, ggrepel

## Key Results
Identified relationships between socio-economic indicators and crime levels across cantons.

## Skills Demonstrated
Statistical analysis, data visualization, regression modeling
